{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"steps\":{\"S01\":\"kept\",\"S02\":\"weakened\",\"S03\":\"kept\",\"S04\":\"kept\",\"S05\":\"kept\",\"S06\":\"weakened\",\"S07\":\"weakened\",\"S08\":\"lost\",\"S09\":\"kept\",\"S10\":\"kept\",\"S11\":\"kept\",\"S12\":\"weakened\",\"S13\":\"weakened\",\"S14\":\"weakened\",\"S15\":\"weakened\",\"S16\":\"kept\",\"S17\":\"weakened\",\"S18\":\"kept\",\"S19\":\"kept\",\"S20\":\"kept\",\"S21\":\"kept\",\"S22\":\"kept\",\"S23\":\"weakened\",\"S24\":\"kept\",\"S25\":\"kept\",\"S26\":\"kept\",\"S27\":\"kept\",\"S28\":\"kept\",\"S29\":\"kept\",\"S30\":\"kept\",\"S31\":\"kept\",\"S32\":\"kept\",\"S33\":\"weakened\",\"S34\":\"weakened\",\"S35\":\"weakened\",\"S36\":\"weakened\",\"S37\":\"kept\",\"S38\":\"kept\",\"S39\":\"lost\",\"S40\":\"kept\",\"S41\":\"weakened\",\"S42\":\"kept\",\"S43\":\"kept\",\"S44\":\"kept\",\"S45\":\"kept\",\"S46\":\"kept\",\"S47\":\"kept\",\"S48\":\"kept\",\"S49\":\"kept\",\"S50\":\"weakened\",\"S51\":\"kept\",\"S52\":\"weakened\",\"S53\":\"kept\"},\"additions\":[{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"1–23\",\"text\":\"反复问自己：你真有资格选吗？\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"1–23\",\"text\":\"开头音乐晃来晃去，像我一直站在原地。\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"24–65\",\"text\":\"事情没变简单，我却松了口气\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"24–65\",\"text\":\"至少不用再站在旁边挑自己的错\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"24–65\",\"text\":\"波兰舞曲的步子越走越有劲\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"24–65\",\"text\":\"选了就不能改\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"24–65\",\"text\":\"必须证明我不是个摇摆不定的人\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"66–91\",\"text\":\"我越逼自己硬撑，越难受\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"66–91\",\"text\":\"有些犹豫不是胆小，是怕伤着别人\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"66–91\",\"text\":\"音乐往前跳，却忽明忽暗\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"66–91\",\"text\":\"怕坚持到最后，把自己在乎的东西弄丢了\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"92–115\",\"text\":\"日子就耗在反复比较里\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"92–115\",\"text\":\"咬牙说“就这样”\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"92–115\",\"text\":\"熟悉的旋律又响起，伴奏却让人心慌\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"92–115\",\"text\":\"不是自己又没出息\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"92–115\",\"text\":\"那些被我压下去的话，确实有道理\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"116–147\",\"text\":\"也想有人听我诉苦，累了能靠一靠\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"116–147\",\"text\":\"以前一这么想，我就骂自己软弱\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"116–147\",\"text\":\"音乐轻下来，像我终于肯听自己的心里话。\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"116–147\",\"text\":\"听懂为什么怕，不等于下回就敢做\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"148–180\",\"text\":\"我想顾着别人，又不想总委屈自己\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"148–180\",\"text\":\"再勇敢，也没法让所有人和所有愿望都满意\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"148–180\",\"text\":\"不选一样会有人失望，只是我能假装“还没定”\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"148–180\",\"text\":\"舒缓的音乐响着，我却难过\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"148–180\",\"text\":\"原来没有两全的办法\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"181–205\",\"text\":\"我只好再对自己说：知道会失去一些东西，也得选\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"181–205\",\"text\":\"像说话一样的旋律再出现，像在催我“别逃”\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"206–213\",\"text\":\"刚鼓起劲，我又舍不得了\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"206–213\",\"text\":\"这些念头不能每次都让我撤销决定\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"206–213\",\"text\":\"慢主题回来，像提醒我先把两边都留在心里。\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"214–215\",\"text\":\"我已经知道自己想往前，也知道怕失去什么\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"214–215\",\"text\":\"开头的旋律闪了一下。\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"216–225\",\"text\":\"过去只要想过别的路，我就认定自己没选好\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"216–225\",\"text\":\"如今旋律轻轻地、断断续续地回来\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"216–225\",\"text\":\"我还是想试试\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"226–241\",\"text\":\"就算明天改主意，今天愿不愿为这个决定负责？\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"226–241\",\"text\":\"我仍觉得别的路也好，仍怕选错\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"226–241\",\"text\":\"带着舞步的音乐又往前走，像我终于迈出脚。\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"242–253\",\"text\":\"别的路也好，别人也可能失望，我还会心软\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"242–253\",\"text\":\"硬撑曾给我力量，也让我忽略真正的顾虑\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"242–253\",\"text\":\"主旋律再次响亮起来\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"242–253\",\"text\":\"这些我都知道，后果我来担。\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"254–288\",\"text\":\"下次碰到难事，我也许还会半夜翻来覆去\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"254–288\",\"text\":\"甚至改主意\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"254–288\",\"text\":\"不能为了果断就不管别人的感受，也不能拿“我还没想好”当作不行动的借口。\"},{\"type\":\"new\",\"segment\":\"254–288\",\"text\":\"最后，柔和与有力的旋律合在一起\"},{\"type\":\"paraphrase\",\"segment\":\"254–288\",\"text\":\"下次又怕了，还是会回来想清楚，然后自己选，自己担。\"}]}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "54bc5805-df0e-456a-b8c3-61cd1fd6f3cd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261021T044042863144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.485, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T04:42:26.352001+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "13a7914b2900dac80d29ec3cc6577a78312662a8901620860d88a2278f3bcb3d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_session